  "reviews": [
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJr8K9asvzaS4R19qBYn2g1i4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGbmJtNVZkbkpKUkZkRFpVczJUbW80WlRaclIxRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Kyō has a really aesthetic indoor-outdoor concept with a calm and cozy atmosphere. The garden lighting at night makes the place feel relaxing and modern, while the indoor area has a clean, modern Japanese-inspired design. Nice spot to chill or catch up with friends.\n\nOne downside is the limited power outlets, so it’s not very ideal for WFC or working long hours with a laptop. But overall, the ambiance is great and worth visiting.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Kyō has a really aesthetic indoor-outdoor concept with a calm and cozy atmosphere. The garden lighting at night makes the place feel relaxing and modern, while the indoor area has a clean, modern Japanese-inspired design. Nice spot to chill or catch up with friends.\n\nOne downside is the limited power outlets, so it’s not very ideal for WFC or working long hours with a laptop. But overall, the ambiance is great and worth visiting.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
