    {
      "name": "places/ChIJr8K9asvzaS4R19qBYn2g1i4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GTFpWUk1hR0ZyVWtsWU9GODFPRmxTWWw5eWNGRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Nice quality coffee especially the Marbled Cold Brew, doesn’t taste watery at all ( considering it’s not a full milk based drink ) with exceptionally strong and unique flavor 🙌🏻\n\nIf you’re a black coffee lover who finds latte is too weak, this one is definitely an in-between option when u’re in the mood of something different 🙇🏻‍♂️\n\nWorth every penny, period ✨✌🏼",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
